message: >-
  If you use op_system, please cite this software and record the exact core
  release version used in your methods. Cite the separately released provider
  independently when applicable.
type: software
title: "op_system: Model specification compiler"
abstract: >-
  Configuration-based specification, normalization, and compilation of
  deterministic ODE/PDE systems, structured fields and nonlocal terms, with
  stochastic reaction artifacts and structured and block evaluation.
